	(descr "SHOU HAN TYPE-C 16P CB0.8 073 (LCSC C2906289), USB-C 2.0 16P mid-mount (sink) receptacle for 0.8 mm boards. Pads/slots from the maker drawing (Recommended PCB layout, thickness 0.80): shell front (product edge) 2.10 in front of the front slot centre, slot pitch 4.00, pad row 4.70..5.70 behind the front slot. The board needs a 9.24-wide cutout from the product edge back to y=-2.25 (drawn by the board outline). Slot pads trimmed to 1.1 x 2.0 / 1.1 x 1.8 so the front slot keeps 0.3 mm copper-to-edge on the small board tab. 3D: JLC/EasyEDA STEP, y offset corrected to -1.11 so its legs sit in the slots (EasyEDA used -0.75).")
